  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4be51c5168caa0d42bd51f33c68daba8, type: 3}
  m_Name: WinterIsComing
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::LetterData
  letterTitle: Winter is coming.
  pages:
  - 'Winter is coming.

    The cold always finds the weak points first. The bridge
    will not hold itself the way it did in the warmer months--timber stiffens, rope
    tightens uneven, and the joints begin to ache until it breaks. It is not sabotage,
    nor neglect. Just time doing what time does. Finish the mill before winter or
    else, it will be dangerous. If in emergency, use the plank at central dock. It
    will be wobbly but it will take a person across.'
  letterImage: {fileID: 0}
